    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly presents 2 Alden Drive, an extended semi-detached family home in a highly sought after and mature location. The property features a large side garden, offering valuable outdoor space and scope for a further extension or potential development (subject to the necessary planning permission).\r\n\r\nAn entrance porch leads to the hallway, with a sitting room to the front and double doors through to a large kitchen dining room to the rear with a bright conservatory opening onto the south-facing rear garden. A side extension provides a utility room and a ground-floor shower room with WC. Upstairs, there are three generous bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe side garden gives the next owner several options: retain it as a larger garden, create more space for outdoor living, or explore its future potential. Together with the south-facing rear aspect, the additional outdoor space is a particularly unique aspect of this home. A driveway to the front provides off-street parking for multiple cars and there is also a block built storage shed to the rear.\r\n\r\nBayside Square Shopping Centre, local schools, sports facilities and parks are all nearby. Bayside DART Station and regular bus services provide convenient access to the city, while the coastal promenade and cycle track offer an easy route to the seafront.\r\n\r\n2 Alden Drive offers a rare opportunity to acquire a solid family home on a generous corner site. Contact JB Kelly on 01 839 3400 to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nPorch\r\nSliding glazed door\r\n1.40 x 0.70m\r\n\r\nInner Hall\r\nLaminate floors\r\n1.85 x 3.25m\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nLaminate flooring, fireplace with gas fire insert.\r\nDouble doors through to…\r\n3.85 x 3.80m\r\n\r\nKitchen Dining Room\r\nLaminate floor and tiled splashbacks, range of fitted floor and wall mounted cupboards,\r\nIntegrated dishwasher, electric oven, hob with extractor over, fridge freezer.\r\n5.85 x 3.90m\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nTiled floor, shelved storage units and presses.\r\nWashing machine, freezer, gas boiler. Door to side garden.\r\n1.95 x 2.45m\r\n\r\nShower Room WC\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC, WHB, cubicle shower\r\n1.85 x 2.45m\r\n\r\nConservatory\r\nLaminate flooring, double glazed PVC windows and rear to sunny rear garden\r\n4.20 x 2.90m\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nShelved hotpress, pull down ladder with access to attic storage\r\n3.55 x 2.05m\r\n\r\nFamily bathroom\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC, WHB, cubicle shower\r\n2.05 x 1.65m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nLarge double bedroom, located to the rear, built-in wardrobes, laminate floors\r\n3.70 x 3.80m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nDouble bedroom, located to the front, built-in wardrobes\r\n2.40 x 3.75m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nSingle bedroom, located to the front, built-in wardrobes\r\n2.55 x 2.45m\r\n\r\n."
      },
